        { q: "What lesson does 'The Necklace' teach us?", options: ["We should be content with what we have and avoid false pride and vanity", "Always borrow expensive jewellery", "Never tell the truth", "Spend all savings on parties"], ans: 0, exp: "Matilda's vanity and dishonesty ruined ten years of her life." }
